---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base
  language="en"
  title="Page not found — DaGaLi Web"
  description="Return to DaGaLi Web."
  noindex
>
  <main id="main" class="container not-found">
    <a class="brand" href="/">
      DGL / DaGaLi Web
    </a>
    <p class="eyebrow">404 / SESSION NOT FOUND</p>
    <h1>Nothing at this address.</h1>
    <p lang="ko">
      페이지를 찾을 수 없습니다. 아래에서 언어를 선택해 돌아가세요.
    </p>
    <nav aria-label="Return home">
      <a class="button primary" href="/">
        English home →
      </a>
      <a class="button secondary" href="/ko/" lang="ko">
        한국어 홈 →
      </a>
    </nav>
  </main>
</Base>
